            "review_text": "Sunshine20655210993\n2 contributions\n0\nJapanese food\nMar 2024 • Family\nDelicious. Therefore, we didn’t limit ourselves to one order, we ordered more. Great staff and fast service. The administrator speaks Russian well. I would especially like to note the service and non-alcoholic drinks. Suitable for children. Miso soup is an instant love. Udon is top notch. The sashimi is fresh and pleasant. I recommend.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 7, 2024",
